# ==============================================================================
# Figure 3: County-level coal PM2.5 and population-weighted exposure, 1940-2020
#
# This script extends the existing Figure 3 workflow to nine decennial years:
#   1940, 1950, 1960, 1970, 1980, 1990, 2000, 2010, and 2020.
#
# The same county spatial unit is used throughout:
#   (a) historical county-mean annual coal PM2.5, 1940-1990
#   (b) modern county-mean annual coal PM2.5, 2000-2020
#   (c) distribution of county-mean annual coal PM2.5
#   (d) national population-weighted exposure (PWE)
#
# Historical inputs (1940-1990):
#   grids_pm25_total_YYYY.fst
#
# Modern inputs (2000, 2010, 2020):
#   grids_pm25_byunit_YYYY.fst
#   The script sums unit-level PM2.5 internally and writes derived total files.
#
# County means are calculated using the same method as the original PWE script:
# raster::extract(..., weights = TRUE), followed by an area-weighted mean.
# Lucas' data: https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/0aejz6jgfoomfay4drlpg/ABgIUJgrcb2zAQ8KyAIHhvw?rlkey=c2xu5i8lqpmgfj4jwqq3t4zjx&dl=0
